    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIREBIRD \u2013 A Fairy-Tale Action-Adventure Platformer. Dark and Fun.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firebird</strong> is a fast-paced 2D action-adventure platformer set in a haunting fairy-tale world where myths fade and shadows come alive. Built in Unreal Engine 5, Firebird challenges players with tight traversal, creative puzzles, and stylish platforming-driven combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agility and timing are everything. From wall jumps to monster vaults, every movement is a weapon\u2014and every level introduces a new mechanic to master. Whether you\u2019re dodging death traps or reshaping reality in dreamlike sub-levels, Firebird never stops evolving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes Firebird Special:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming is the Core</strong> \u2013 Combat, exploration, and problem-solving are all driven by movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Full of Secrets</strong> \u2013 Explore three eerie biomes and surreal Dream Worlds where light and shadow shift the rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Outsmart mythical guardians using skillful traversal and smart mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals</strong> \u2013 Dark fantasy meets magical realism in gorgeous 2.5D levels powered by Unreal Engine 5.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Filler, All Killer</strong> \u2013 Fresh mechanics in every stage. Tight pacing. Zero grind.<br><br>Planned for PC and consoles in <strong>Q1 2026</strong>, Firebird blends the challenge of <i>Hollow Knight</i> with the magic of <i>Ori and the Blind Forest</i>, offering an unforgettable ride through a fading world\u2014and a second chance to reignite its flame.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIREBIRD \u2013 A Fairy-Tale Action-Adventure Platformer. Dark and Fun.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firebird</strong> is a fast-paced 2D action-adventure platformer set in a haunting fairy-tale world where myths fade and shadows come alive. Built in Unreal Engine 5, Firebird challenges players with tight traversal, creative puzzles, and stylish platforming-driven combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agility and timing are everything. From wall jumps to monster vaults, every movement is a weapon\u2014and every level introduces a new mechanic to master. Whether you\u2019re dodging death traps or reshaping reality in dreamlike sub-levels, Firebird never stops evolving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes Firebird Special:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming is the Core</strong> \u2013 Combat, exploration, and problem-solving are all driven by movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Full of Secrets</strong> \u2013 Explore three eerie biomes and surreal Dream Worlds where light and shadow shift the rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Outsmart mythical guardians using skillful traversal and smart mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals</strong> \u2013 Dark fantasy meets magical realism in gorgeous 2.5D levels powered by Unreal Engine 5.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Filler, All Killer</strong> \u2013 Fresh mechanics in every stage. Tight pacing. Zero grind.<br><br>Planned for PC and consoles in <strong>Q1 2026</strong>, Firebird blends the challenge of <i>Hollow Knight</i> with the magic of <i>Ori and the Blind Forest</i>, offering an unforgettable ride through a fading world\u2014and a second chance to reignite its flame.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A fast-paced 2D action-adventure platformer set in a dark fairy tale world. Master creative traversal, uncover secrets, and reshape reality through light and shadow as you battle mythic guardians in handcrafted, atmospheric levels.",
